 /**
  * What a plan costs per month, in whole cents (cut to the cent).
+ * Weekly plans: price × 52 ÷ 12, rounded to nearest cent.
+ * Monthly plans: price per month.
+ * Yearly plans: price ÷ 12 per month, rounded to nearest cent.
  * @param {{ price: number, cycle: string }} sub
